<title>NETHERLANDS: Dutch prime minister to visit Lisbon, Madrid, Rome.</title>
<headline>Dutch prime minister to visit Lisbon, Madrid, Rome.</headline>
<dateline>THE HAGUE 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Dutch Prime Minister Wim Kok will visit Lisbon and Madrid on May 12 and Rome one day later in preparation for the European summit which will be held in Amsterdam in June, the Dutch government said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Kok will have talks with Portuguese Prime Minister Antonio Guterres, Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar and Italian Prime Minister Romano Prodi.</p>
<p>The Netherlands currently hold the presidency of the European Union.</p>
</text>
